\uc0\u10022  I've reviewed src/components/intel/IntelTrading.tsx, a React component for intel exchange.\
\
  Key Points:\
\
   * Purpose: Facilitates intel trading between teams, visualizing intel value and trade fairness.\
   * Functionality: Allows selection of intel to offer/request, displays a trade preview with fairness assessment, and\
     provides client-side validation.\
\
  Observations:\
\
   * Critical Functional Gap: The onTradeComplete callback relies on an external service to perform the actual intel\
     transfer, but the underlying transferIntel function in IntelService.ts is a placeholder. This means intel trades are\
     not fully functional.\
   * Intel Expiration Inconsistency: The isIntelExpired logic might not align with the expiresAt timestamp in IntelItem or\
     IntelGenerationService.ts.\
   * Type Safety: any types are present in IntelItem and Colony resource access.\
